{"id":"7fe16ce9c76c6f11fe9f6382393a33fb83deccc9","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1240540","title":"请教下, 用 claude/codex 写代码太贵了, 打算尝试下国产模型, 如何处理?","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"wises","excerpt":"程序员 - @wises - 大概类似 sol/opus5 左右的智力的国产大模型, 各位有实际测试过的能推荐下吗?","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n        \n        <p>大概类似 sol/opus5 左右的智力的国产大模型, 各位有实际测试过的能推荐下吗?</p>\n        \n    </div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/国产\"><li></li> 国产</a><a href=\"/tag/模型\"><li></li> 模型</a><a href=\"/tag/推荐\"><li></li> 推荐</a></P><p><span>56 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-09 20:35:40 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18064193\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ebea/d1b0/254966_normal.png?m=1779740858\" alt=\"noahhhh\" data-uid=\"254966\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/noahhhh\">noahhhh</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 03:45:42 +08:00\">22h 14m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>GLM 5.3 flash ，要 sol 这个级别的只有 Kimi 了，但是也不便宜</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18064199\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6ed4ee4dd2e384a9d8d47d2e7f43c5c4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"maolon\" data-uid=\"442547\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/maolon\">maolon</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 04:29:26 +08:00\">21h 30m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>glm 5.3 (非 flash)和 kimi k3 max 就这两，适合写码的只有 glm 5.3 / flash ，还有新的 ds v4.1 （还在灰度）可以关注一下，<br>另外国产模型没有 sol 和 opus5 这一个等级的，kimi 只是接近 sol</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18064210\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/326b525245435e15befb7f38bce37ba9?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"mooyo\" data-uid=\"401342\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/mooyo\">mooyo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 05:14:04 +08:00\">20h 46m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 6</span>\n                    \n                    <p>算上 reset 的话，chatgpt 订阅可能比国模的 coding plan 还便宜</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18064254\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f28352aaca1c3c1f11ccfa47289388e5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"methylation5mc20\" data-uid=\"847170\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/methylation5mc20\">methylation5mc20</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 07:47:48 +08:00\">18h 12m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>说实话你要用 api 的话都贵，还是订阅最合适。总体来说，国内大模型要达到你的这个要求要达到你的这个要求恐怕只有 kimi 了，但是说实话 kimi 也真不便宜，有这个钱还不如去订阅 Codex ，最经济和性价比平衡的恐怕还是 codex 的订阅，再加上重置其实算得上良心了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18064266\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/02a1/dd53/112102_normal.png?m=1760508787\" alt=\"sagnitude\" data-uid=\"112102\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sagnitude\">sagnitude</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 08:10:31 +08:00\">17h 49m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>价格上，哪怕是 ds4flash ，可能也比不上 gpt 20x<br>今天早上 ds4flash 降价了 60%，可能价格能和 gpt 20x 掰掰手腕了，但是还是建议 gpt 20x</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18064278\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/53b3b92c2ed6f9143a712dec16100a84?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"TimeDong\" data-uid=\"630435\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/TimeDong\">TimeDong</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 08:25:08 +08:00\">17h 35m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>接近 sol 的只有 kimi k3 ，但是即使用 kimi code ，体感 699 也用不了很多，目前是 5x 用 astra 做架构，k3 写。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18064292\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9854/29c2/832630_normal.png?m=1788746755\" alt=\"benbond\" data-uid=\"832630\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/benbond\">benbond</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 08:32:01 +08:00\">17h 28m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>glm,但是跟 codex 还是有差距,需要精细的指挥</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18064307\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3b198446b72d1e5a3b0090f106a75f3c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"sampeng\" data-uid=\"19005\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sampeng\">sampeng</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 08:38:52 +08:00\">17h 21m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>如果单位是 任务/token 数/时间 也就是单位时间的 token 成本，国内最少是海外的两倍。因为…不是太慢就是要返工</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18064363\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d6ca/4972/312242_normal.png?m=1780449117\" alt=\"Sezxy\" data-uid=\"312242\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Sezxy\">Sezxy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 08:56:22 +08:00\">17h 3m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>智谱的 v2 max 套餐，年付月均 320 多</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18064413\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f399/d5ea/223096_normal.png?m=1600056410\" alt=\"syubo2810\" data-uid=\"223096\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/syubo2810\">syubo2810</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 09:09:10 +08:00\">16h 51m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>国产更贵，除了公司必须买国产，其他都建议 openai</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18064417\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d5a6/ae01/429976_normal.png?m=1715391893\" alt=\"spacebound\" data-uid=\"429976\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/spacebound\">spacebound</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 09:09:22 +08:00\">16h 50m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>实际用下来，最具性价比的还得是 chatgpt ，用国产模型你会发现更贵</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18064426\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b989/ed4a/91590_normal.png?m=1776430252\" alt=\"fang2hou\" data-uid=\"91590\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/fang2hou\">fang2hou</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 09:11:53 +08:00\">16h 48m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>公司订购的话，Claude for Enterprise ，Bedrock ，Azure 都是纯走 API 计费，OpenAI 的也只有 5x 的 premium seat 。国模随便选都便宜得多。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18064496\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7ed563fb491d74eebf02f624f7e99768?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"poxiaohy\" data-uid=\"25781\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/poxiaohy\">poxiaohy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 09:25:35 +08:00\">16h 34m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>GLM 5.3 flash 或者等明天的 DeepSeek-v4.1-flash</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18064535\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/382f/1f51/414567_normal.png?m=1691026308\" alt=\"cheng6563\" data-uid=\"414567\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>25</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cheng6563\">cheng6563</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 09:32:11 +08:00\">16h 28m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>当前最便宜的就是反重力哈基米 BUG 账号。<br>gemini-3.8-flash 已经是完全达到能用的程度了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18064577\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/31a743b099a52782d43f7c290a60d283?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"me876\" data-uid=\"374793\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>27</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/me876\">me876</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 09:37:54 +08:00\">16h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>国内确实贵，我就用过 codebuddy ，我之前买是 30 块钱 1500token ，几个小时就用完了（现在不知道有没有涨价）。现在 codebuddy 上面 hy3 和 hy4 模型是限时免费的，抓紧白嫖，写出来东西我觉得质量还是可以的。等不免费的时候又要古法编码了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18064686\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c8e1afd1f676b75d1ab707024079c379?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"amulo\" data-uid=\"82373\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>29</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/amulo\">amulo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 09:52:04 +08:00\">16h 8m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>如果要差不多质量的，那可能还不如 Codex 性价比高</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18064832\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b38c/efb6/36502_normal.png?m=1698393818\" alt=\"RexKang\" data-uid=\"36502\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>31</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/RexKang\">RexKang</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 10:09:52 +08:00\">15h 50m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>目前来看，glm-5.3-flash 配合 zcode 还行，当然要叠加 [闲时任务] 和 [夜间免费] 这两个 buffer 才行。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18065027\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5bf1fabfa0060cbcf704d53b13a39ac0?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"mlcq\" data-uid=\"537324\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>32</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/mlcq\">mlcq</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 10:34:53 +08:00\">15h 25m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>ds4flash 好像没降多少，算了下，高峰期未命中由 3/9 降到了 2/8 ，就降了 1 元</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18065104\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/acd6/85e6/497030_normal.png?m=1783483367\" alt=\"WaldenHorizon\" data-uid=\"497030\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>33</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/WaldenHorizon\">WaldenHorizon</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 10:44:59 +08:00\">15h 15m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不要看表面价格，agent/模型聪明一点会成倍提高效率和质量，除非你的收入实在不高<br>现在就是 claude 没封优先用，封了就 codex</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18065258\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/bb4c/5ae4/96238_normal.png?m=1425637722\" alt=\"SmiteChow\" data-uid=\"96238\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>35</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/SmiteChow\">SmiteChow</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 11:02:22 +08:00\">14h 57m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>加入 work Buddy 阵营，免费领积分薅羊毛</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18065715\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c2cb840e1682930b41c58520b5836c22?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"cellsyx\" data-uid=\"604584\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>38</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cellsyx\">cellsyx</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 11:59:54 +08:00\">14h 0m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你用量大的话，国产大概率比 GPT 贵，可能比 Claude 便宜些。而且国产要到 sol 这级别估计只有 Kimi K3 了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18065743\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2cf2/97f5/115210_normal.png?m=1706108503\" alt=\"theohateonion\" data-uid=\"115210\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>39</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/theohateonion\">theohateonion</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 12:04:37 +08:00\">13h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>glm5.3 或者 deepseek v4 flash 做 worker ，astra 做 plan 和 review ，基本上是一个甜点区间。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18066338\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/03a0/4432/223857_normal.png?m=1709193364\" alt=\"vipfts\" data-uid=\"223857\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>40</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/vipfts\">vipfts</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 14:10:43 +08:00\">11h 49m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>别用国产，一用就从高贵的边低劣的了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18066470\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a751/22dd/174870_normal.png?m=1477905741\" alt=\"brucedone\" data-uid=\"174870\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>41</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/brucedone\">brucedone</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 14:29:25 +08:00\">11h 30m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/mlcq\">mlcq</a> 你高峰写代码场景，会一直没命中吗？一般搭配它自家的 harness ，缓存命中率在 96%+</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18067078\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/abdf/c1c3/440329_normal.png?m=1678688049\" alt=\"0703wzq\" data-uid=\"440329\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>43</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/0703wzq\">0703wzq</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 16:00:27 +08:00\">9h 59m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>目前用 gemini-3.8-flash 在尝试，体感上 比 glm-5.3-flash  好上不少....</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18067152\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/031b/9c8d/375269_normal.png?m=1736237077\" alt=\"dingwen07\" data-uid=\"375269\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>44</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dingwen07\">dingwen07</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 16:11:19 +08:00\">9h 48m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>其实国产模型不一定比 OA 家的便宜，因为国内不能容易的买到卡<br>如果考虑模型的智能水平，那差距更大</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18067571\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/cf67a8561d8388e297860e5693c5d2e0?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"70nY\" data-uid=\"304475\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>49</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/70nY\">70nY</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 17:21:56 +08:00\">8h 38m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>国产的更少，chatgpt plus 算下来一周能有 100 刀多的额度，买 glm lite 配上 zcode 不在高峰用最多就 70 多刀</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18067585\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4491/2f87/665929_normal.png?m=1756483163\" alt=\"Moatkon\" data-uid=\"665929\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>50</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Moatkon\">Moatkon</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 17:23:10 +08:00\">8h 37m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>强烈推荐 deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp ，真的很便宜。我用它做了 x2post 站,全流程打通,花了几十。体感比 codex 好用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18067590\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/93100e90064ff70a55a0d430fa2a1249?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ReinXD\" data-uid=\"641437\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>51</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ReinXD\">ReinXD</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 17:23:56 +08:00\">8h 36m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>deepseek/glm 自己选择，除此之外都不建议</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18067838\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4942/d5cf/38593_normal.png?m=1788162258\" alt=\"chemzqm\" data-uid=\"38593\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>52</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/chemzqm\">chemzqm</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 18:10:26 +08:00\">7h 49m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>便宜模型慢一点还好，就怕它 bug 多还得反复修</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18068158\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/fcb2f9d15e718795078d58a674054610?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"noahliaszn\" data-uid=\"159995\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>54</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/noahliaszn\">noahliaszn</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 20:28:26 +08:00\">5h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>国产贵的妈都不认识了 glm5.3 lite 多贵, 性价比不如 gpt/claude</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18068176\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/17d3/d5c9/71891_normal.png?m=1752241801\" alt=\"106npo\" data-uid=\"71891\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>55</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/106npo\">106npo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 20:35:17 +08:00\">5h 24m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>国产可还要贵个好几倍的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18068177\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/47cf01ddc9eb4a1e41931f166d7197ac?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Nullpinter\" data-uid=\"482630\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>56</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Nullpinter\">Nullpinter</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 20:35:40 +08:00\">5h 24m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>如果你用的中转站，那大概率不会更便宜。如果你用的订阅，那你 reset 没用爽？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"大概类似 sol/opus5 左右的智力的国产大模型, 各位有实际测试过的能推荐下吗? 国产 模型 推荐56 replies • 2026-09-09 20:35:40 +08:00 1 noahhhh 22h 14m ago via Android GLM 5.3 flash ，要 sol 这个级别的只有 Kimi 了，但是也不便宜 3 maolon 21h 30m ago glm 5.3 (非 flash)和 kimi k3 max 就这两，适合写码的只有 glm 5.3 / flash ，还有新的 ds v4.1 （还在灰度）可以关注一下，另外国产模型没有 sol 和 opus5 这一个等级的，kimi 只是接近 sol 4 mooyo 20h 46m ago 6 算上 reset 的话，chatgpt 订阅可能比国模的 coding plan 还便宜 6 methylation5mc20 18h 12m ago 说实话你要用 api 的话都贵，还是订阅最合适。总体来说，国内大模型要达到你的这个要求要达到你的这个要求恐怕只有 kimi 了，但是说实话 kimi 也真不便宜，有这个钱还不如去订阅 Codex ，最经济和性价比平衡的恐怕还是 codex 的订阅，再加上重置其实算得上良心了 7 sagnitude 17h 49m ago 价格上，哪怕是 ds4flash ，可能也比不上 gpt 20x今天早上 ds4flash 降价了 60%，可能价格能和 gpt 20x 掰掰手腕了，但是还是建议 gpt 20x 9 TimeDong 17h 35m ago 接近 sol 的只有 kimi k3 ，但是即使用 kimi code ，体感 699 也用不了很多，目前是 5x 用 astra 做架构，k3 写。 10 benbond 17h 28m ago glm,但是跟 codex 还是有差距,需要精细的指挥 12 sampeng 17h 21m ago via iPhone 如果单位是 任务/token 数/时间 也就是单位时间的 token 成本，国内最少是海外的两倍。因为…不是太慢就是要返工 17 Sezxy 17h 3m ago 智谱的 v2 max 套餐，年付月均 320 多 20 syubo2810 16h 51m ago 国产更贵，除了公司必须买国产，其他都建议 openai 21 spacebound 16h 50m ago 实际用下来，最具性价比的还得是 chatgpt ，用国产模型你会发现更贵 22 fang2hou 16h 48m ago 公司订购的话，Claude for Enterprise ，Bedrock ，Azure 都是纯走 API 计费，OpenAI 的也只有 5x 的 premium seat 。国模随便选都便宜得多。 24 poxiaohy 16h 34m ago GLM 5.3 flash 或者等明天的 DeepSeek-v4.1-flash 25 cheng6563 16h 28m ago 当前最便宜的就是反重力哈基米 BUG 账号。gemini-3.8-flash 已经是完全达到能用的程度了。 27 me876 16h 22m ago 国内确实贵，我就用过 codebuddy ，我之前买是 30 块钱 1500token ，几个小时就用完了（现在不知道有没有涨价）。现在 codebuddy 上面 hy3 和 hy4 模型是限时免费的，抓紧白嫖，写出来东西我觉得质量还是可以的。等不免费的时候又要古法编码了。 29 amulo 16h 8m ago 如果要差不多质量的，那可能还不如 Codex 性价比高 31 RexKang 15h 50m ago 目前来看，glm-5.3-flash 配合 zcode 还行，当然要叠加 [闲时任务] 和 [夜间免费] 这两个 buffer 才行。 32 mlcq 15h 25m ago ds4flash 好像没降多少，算了下，高峰期未命中由 3/9 降到了 2/8 ，就降了 1 元 33 WaldenHorizon 15h 15m ago 不要看表面价格，agent/模型聪明一点会成倍提高效率和质量，除非你的收入实在不高现在就是 claude 没封优先用，封了就 codex 35 SmiteChow 14h 57m ago 加入 work Buddy 阵营，免费领积分薅羊毛 38 cellsyx 14h 0m ago via Android 你用量大的话，国产大概率比 GPT 贵，可能比 Claude 便宜些。而且国产要到 sol 这级别估计只有 Kimi K3 了。 39 theohateonion 13h 55m ago glm5.3 或者 deepseek v4 flash 做 worker ，astra 做 plan 和 review ，基本上是一个甜点区间。 40 vipfts 11h 49m ago 别用国产，一用就从高贵的边低劣的了 41 brucedone 11h 30m ago @mlcq 你高峰写代码场景，会一直没命中吗？一般搭配它自家的 harness ，缓存命中率在 96%+ 43 0703wzq 9h 59m ago 目前用 gemini-3.8-flash 在尝试，体感上 比 glm-5.3-flash 好上不少.... 44 dingwen07 9h 48m ago 其实国产模型不一定比 OA 家的便宜，因为国内不能容易的买到卡如果考虑模型的智能水平，那差距更大 49 70nY 8h 38m ago 国产的更少，chatgpt plus 算下来一周能有 100 刀多的额度，买 glm lite 配上 zcode 不在高峰用最多就 70 多刀 50 Moatkon 8h 37m ago 强烈推荐 deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp ，真的很便宜。我用它做了 x2post 站,全流程打通,花了几十。体感比 codex 好用 51 ReinXD 8h 36m ago deepseek/glm 自己选择，除此之外都不建议 52 chemzqm 7h 49m ago 便宜模型慢一点还好，就怕它 bug 多还得反复修 54 noahliaszn 5h 31m ago 国产贵的妈都不认识了 glm5.3 lite 多贵, 性价比不如 gpt/claude 55 106npo 5h 24m ago 国产可还要贵个好几倍的 56 Nullpinter 5h 24m ago 如果你用的中转站，那大概率不会更便宜。如果你用的订阅，那你 reset 没用爽？","fetched_at":"2026-09-09T18:02:03.694Z","ok":true}